Inclusion Criteria:

* incident patients on haemodialysis (CKD stage 5);
* an informed consent will be provided at the study entry.

Exclusion Criteria:

* congenital prolongation of QT segment syndrome;
* QTc \>440 ms; increased QTd;
* bradycardia \<50 bpm;
